  49:     - Build one output panel with the same height, frame color, fill color, and sprite.
  50:     - Continue the sprite's diagonal motion one more panel to the right.
  51:     - Because the output is a standalone panel, advance by the full panel width, not the shared-border spacing.
  52: 
  53:     Key insight
  54:     - The panels are consecutive frames of motion; the output is the next frame after the sequence.
